OL,5,M'HEAVY DAMAGE' TO IRAQI ARMS THREAT 102
OL,7,COIL REFINING CAPACITY HALVED - ARMY
OL,9,CSIX IRAQIS CAPTURED IN BORDER CLASHG103
OL,10,CALLIES FLY MORE THAN 12,000 SORTIESG104
