OL,2,V55555555CBOMBERS HIT IRAQ'S
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CN-WEAPON, CHEMICAL PLANTS
OL,5, Allied bombing raids have caused
OL,6, "significant damage" to Iraq's chemical
OL,7, and nuclear weapon capabilities, the
OL,8, War Cabinet has been told.
OL,10, It also heard the attacks on chemical
OL,11, and nuclear weapon plants had not put
OL,12, the civilian population at risk.
OL,14, And Iraqi oil refining capacity has
OL,15, been reduced by 50% because of the
OL,16, bombing, Major General Alex Harley told
OL,17, a Gulf War news conference in London.
OL,19, He added that "virtually all the main
OL,20, Iraqi military airfields" had been hit,
OL,21, reducing their capacity,and Scud mobile
OL,22, launchers were constantly being reduced
OL,23,F]DFrom 23-01-91 / teletextarchive.com
