OL,2,V55555555CSIX IRAQIS CAPTURED
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CIN BORDER SKIRMISH
OL,5, Six Iraqis have been taken prisoner in
OL,6, artillery skirmishes on the border
OL,7, between Saudi Arabia and Kuwait, said a
OL,8, US spokesman.
OL,10, He said small arms fire had been
OL,11, exchanged with the Iraqis but there was
OL,12, no indication of a major ground attack.
OL,14, Earlier, Western military sources in
OL,15, Dhahran denied a report by the Iranian
OL,16, news agency IRNA that Iraqi ground
OL,17, forces had launched a ground attack.
OL,19, The Tehran news agency claimed that
OL,20, Iraqi forces had apparently occupied
OL,21, parts of the Saudi territory near the
OL,22, border between the two countries.
OL,23,F]DFrom 23-01-91 / teletextarchive.com
