OL,2,V55555555CALLIES FLY MORE
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CTHAN 12,000 SORTIES
OL,5, Operation Desert Storm is on track
OL,6, despite bad weather - and Allied planes
OL,7, have carried out more than 12,000
OL,8, sorties, said a US military spokesman.
OL,10, He added that intelligence reports
OL,11, revealed a bombed plant in Baghdad
OL,12, which the Iraqis claimed was for baby
OL,13, food was making chemical weapons.
OL,15, Earlier, Iranian news agency IRNA said
OL,16, Allied planes have launched successive
OL,17, bombing raids on the southern Iraqi
OL,18, ports of Basra and Faw.
OL,20,SGThe Allies have lost a total of 15
OL,21, aircraft in combat, including four RAF
OL,22, Tornados.
OL,23,F]DFrom 23-01-91 / teletextarchive.com
