OL,2,V55555555CTHREE DEAD IN SCUD
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CATTACK ON TEL AVIV
OL,5, Three woman died of apparent heart
OL,6, attacks and at least 90 people were
OL,7, wounded - three critically - in an
OL,8, Iraqi Scud missile attack on Tel Aviv.
OL,10, Two incoming Scuds were downed by US
OL,11, Patriot missiles, but one got through,
OL,12, said CBS correspondent Tom Fenton.
OL,14, Israeli Army spokesman Brig Gen Nachman
OL,15, Shai said the Scud hit about 20 houses.
OL,16, Cries of people trapped in the debris
OL,17, were heard for several hours afterwards
OL,19, NBC's Martin Fletcher, standing on the
OL,20, edge of a crater, reported that "three
OL,21, square blocks were smashed" and said
OL,22, the scene was "like something from WW2"
OL,23,F]DFrom 23-01-91 / teletextarchive.com
