OL,2,V55555555CSHAMIR CABINET ENDS
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CEMERGENCY SESSION
OL,5, Israeli Prime Minister Yitzhak Shamir's
OL,6, cabinet and military officials have met
OL,7, for emergency talks after the third
OL,8, Iraqi attack on Tel Aviv.CSee p105
OL,10, The talks have now ended but Health
OL,11, Minister Ehud Olmert said earlier the
OL,12, govt's attitude had not changed: "It is
OL,13, not whether we will respond, but when."
OL,15, US envoy Zalman Shoval hinted Israel
OL,16, might hold back:"It's not an eye for an
OL,17, eye,but how best to defend our people".
OL,19, But Tel Aviv Mayor Shlomo Lahat said:
OL,20, "The answer is to kill Saddam, destroy
OL,21, his army and make a new order in the
OL,22, Middle East under the United States".
OL,23,F]DFrom 23-01-91 / teletextarchive.com
