OL,2,V55555555CIRAQ SAYS FUEL
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CSALES SUSPENDED
OL,5, Iraq has said it is temporarily
OL,6, suspending fuel sales across the
OL,7, country.
OL,9, The announcement from the oil ministry
OL,10, was broadcast on Radio Baghdad.
OL,12, It said the suspension, "for a short
OL,13, period", applied to "all fuel, benzine
OL,14, and oil" being sold at petrol stations.
OL,16, The decision was made "with the aim of
OL,17, organising the process of providing the
OL,18, citizens and state offices with fuel".
OL,20, Earlier, Iraq said 41 people had been
OL,21, killed and 191 wounded in four days of
OL,22, Allied air and missile attacks.
OL,23,F]DFrom 23-01-91 / teletextarchive.com
