OL,2,V55555555CAMERICAN OFFICES IN
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CISTANBUL BOMBED
OL,5, Bombs have exploded at two American
OL,6, business offices in Istanbul, injuring
OL,7, a woman, the semi-official Anatolian
OL,8, news agency reported.
OL,10, They went off at the offices of the
OL,11, Turkish-American Board Council and the
OL,12, American Bureau of Shipping.
OL,14, A sprayed message at ABS signed Dev-Sol
OL,15, - an extreme left-wing group - read:
OL,16, "The Middle East belongs to the peoples
OL,17, of the Middle East".
OL,19,SGTwo bomb blasts killed one man and
OL,20, damaged two Beirut banks partly owned
OL,21, by French and Saudi interests, security
OL,22, sources in the Lebanese capital said.
OL,23,F]DFrom 23-01-91 / teletextarchive.com
