OL,2,V55555555CSOVIET TROOPS SEIZE
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CVILNIUS WAREHOUSE
OL,5, Soviet soldiers armed with automatic
OL,6, weapons have seized a newsprint
OL,7, warehouse in the centre of Vilnius, a
OL,8, parliamentary spokeswoman said.
OL,10, Rita Dapkus said the soldiers were
OL,11, accompanied by two members of the
OL,12, Lithuanian Communist Party.
OL,14, She said that one of the Party members
OL,15, said they were acting in accordance
OL,16, with a Soviet presidential decree to
OL,17, enforce property rights.
OL,19,SGUS Secretary of State James Baker has
OL,20, hinted that the US may proceed with the
OL,21, Moscow summit planned for next month,
OL,22, despite the crackdown in the Baltics.
OL,23,F]DFrom 23-01-91 / teletextarchive.com
